{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "%@ and we'll look into it. Purchases in the App Store or Google Play follow Apple's or Google's refund rules." : {
      "comment" : "Answers whether Plus can be refunded; the argument is the link “Write to us”",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@. Wir schauen uns das an. Für Käufe im App Store oder bei Google Play gelten die Erstattungsregeln von Apple bzw. Google."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ y lo revisaremos. Las compras en el App Store o en Google Play siguen las políticas de reembolso de Apple o Google."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ et nous étudierons ta demande. Les achats sur l’App Store ou Google Play sont soumis aux règles de remboursement d’Apple ou de Google."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ e valuteremo la richiesta. Gli acquisti su App Store o Google Play seguono le regole di rimborso di Apple o Google."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%@」からご連絡いただければ、内容を確認します。App StoreまたはGoogle Playでの購入には、AppleまたはGoogleの返金規定が適用されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@로 연락해 주시면 확인해 볼게요. App Store나 Google Play에서 구매한 경우 Apple이나 Google의 환불 규정이 적용돼요."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@, a przyjrzymy się sprawie. Przy zakupach w App Store lub Google Play obowiązują zasady zwrotów Apple lub Google."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ e a gente analisa o caso. Compras na App Store ou no Google Play seguem as regras de reembolso da Apple ou do Google."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@, inceleyelim. App Store veya Google Play üzerinden yapılan satın alımlarda Apple’ın veya Google’ın iade kuralları geçerlidir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
